Hi team,

We do the half-year stock count in the London warehouse this Friday, 31 July, from 13:00.

We count:
- full 19-litre bottles and empty bottles
- spare coolers, by product id (WC-100, WC-150, WC-200 and so on)
- boxes of paper cups
- filters and spare parts on the shelves at the back

Please have all returned bottles stacked in the returns area by 12:30, and do not move stock between areas while we count. Each pair of people gets a count sheet and one area of the warehouse. When your area is done, hand the sheet to me in the warehouse office.

Drivers will be back from their routes by 13:00 that day, so we have enough hands. We should be finished by 16:00.

Kind regards,
Lee
